## Interface: 16001
## Title: High Fidelity World Map
## Notes: Overlays high-resolution minimap exploration textures onto the world map for a satellite-view experience. Built from World of Warcraft Forever (wow_classic_beta 1.60.1.69913) map data. Type /hfwm to toggle.
## Author: HighFidelityWorldMap
## Category: Map
## SavedVariables: HighFidelityWorldMapDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Map02
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1701034

# Ace3 libs are fetched at build/dev time rather than committed; see .pkgmeta
# and src/addon/client/dev/fetch-libs.sh. Kept flat at the addon root (not under Libs\) so the
# CI lint job's plain-bash file-exists check, which does not understand
# backslashed subdirectories, still finds it.
embeds.xml

# Generated data tables (src/generator writes them), under data/. Plain
# globals with no dependency on the addon namespace, so they load first and
# Config.lua / Namespace.lua can fold them in. The low-resolution map art
# (WorldMap\*.blp, the world and continent maps) ships in this addon and is
# not listed: it is read through its file path, see Config.FDID_BASE. The
# high-resolution art is in the optional Art addon, see Config.HD_BASE.
# data/FDIDMap.lua: FileDataID -> tile path, plus the HD continent layouts.
# data/MinimapTiles.lua: where each of the client's minimap tiles sits on a
# zone map. data/CaveTiles.lua: the same for cave and mine floors.
data/FDIDMap.lua
data/MinimapTiles.lua
data/CaveTiles.lua
# data/IndoorTiles.lua, data/IndoorData.lua: the same for every other indoor
# area (buildings, houses), used only while Other indoors is on. IndoorTiles
# also holds the Ironforge and Undercity canvases, which data/SubMaps.lua
# places on those cities' world maps.
data/IndoorTiles.lua
data/SubMaps.lua
# data/ZoneOverlays.lua, data/ZoneShapes.lua: how many exploration overlays
# each zone has, and where each zone lies on the continent and World maps,
# for the World/Continent Fog of War (ZoneFog.lua). data/ZoneOverlayTiles.lua:
# those overlays' art, drawn on the native map when Fog of War is off
# (Exploration.lua).
data/ZoneOverlays.lua
data/ZoneOverlayTiles.lua
data/ZoneShapes.lua
data/CaveData.lua
data/IndoorData.lua
data/AreaLabelData.lua
Namespace.lua
Config.lua
TexturePool.lua
ZoneFog.lua
BaseArt.lua
MapFrameBg.lua
Exploration.lua
Watchdog.lua
Renderer.lua
CaveTable.lua
Cave.lua
CaveRenderer.lua
Taint.lua
MapMemory.lua
ZoomLevels.lua
ResetView.lua
KeepCentered.lua
Integrations.lua
ToggleButton.lua
Coords.lua
AreaLabels.lua
Commands.lua
Options.lua
Core.lua
